CODE OF CONDUCT

Be respectful, constructive, and considerate. Harassment, discrimination,
threats, sexualized conduct, deliberate disruption, and publication of another
person's private information are not permitted in project spaces.

Maintainers may remove content or restrict participation when conduct harms the
community. Report conduct concerns privately through the contact method on the
maintainer's GitHub profile at https://github.com/YawnBear. Do not disclose
sensitive reports in a public issue.
